## Interface: 20506
## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Vault
## Author: Devin
## Version: 1.1.0
## Notes: The bank, commanded — one unified window over every bank slot and bank bag, grouped into sections, searchable by quality, slot, item level and how long a thing has been sitting there, sortable in a pass that gives slots back rather than merely tidying, and browsable from anywhere in the world. It keeps a standing report on what is dead weight, what should be on your belt and what is quietly costing you space; it remembers every character's vault, so any item tooltip in the game can tell you that you already own four and three of them are on your alt.
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Bag_08
## SavedVariables: CommanderVaultDB, CommanderVaultCache
## RequiredDeps: Commander_Events

